    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Compile the digital audit, battery test sheet, fuel level note, and FASTag receipt into a single handover package. Obtain the client’s signature on the checklist to confirm acceptance. This comprehensive record supports a smooth Delhi to Mumbai transport service and aligns with the transparent pricing of Unisafe Cargo Packers Movers Delhi.</p>
